 align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Lives with spouse with no long-term illness</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2523</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">36.1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4974</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">25.5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">7497</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">29.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Lives with spouse with long-term illness</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1227</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">30.3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2954</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">24.7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4181</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">26.3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Lives with other with no long-term illness</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">507</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">29.4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1801</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">24.2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2308</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">25.4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Lives with other with long-term illness</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">146</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">21.2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">600</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">23.5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">746</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">23.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Primary coresident employed FT</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">762</td><td align="ch